# AeroVLA policy inference: two raw observation views plus a pre-tokenized
# prompt; the worker returns the model's raw autoregressive text output.
# Tokenization/prompt assembly and action parsing/dequantization stay in the
# planner (Tool) layer; image headers carry the observation time.
string request_id
sensor_msgs/Image front
sensor_msgs/Image down
int64[] input_ids
---
bool success
string error_code
string message
string request_id
std_msgs/Header header
string model_version
string device
string text
int64[] gen_ids
float64 total_ms
